<title>UK: Granada sells Brown's Hotel to Raffles.</title>
<headline>Granada sells Brown's Hotel to Raffles.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British leisure firm the Granada Group Plc said on Monday it was selling Brown's Hotel to Raffles Holdings, a unit of Singapore's DBS Land, for 45 million stg.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the sale represented a premium to book value of 5.6 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
